### 1. 查询所有设备
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices

### 2. 根据ID查询设备
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1

### 3. 新增设备
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "温度传感器A",
  "deviceCode": "SN-001",
  "typeId": 1,
  "status": 1,
  "location": "3号楼2层"
}

### 4. 更新设备（ID必须一致）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "deviceName": "温度传感器A-升级版",
  "deviceCode": "SN-001",
  "typeId": 1,
  "status": 1,
  "location": "3号楼3层"
}

### 5. 删除设备
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1

### 6. 查询在线设备
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/online

### 7. 模糊搜索设备
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices/search?name=温度

### 8. 更新设备状态
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1/status?status=0